archify (https://github.com/tt-a1i/archify) by tt-a1i, Apache License 2.0, and diagram-design (https://github.com/cathrynlavery/diagram-design) by Cathryn Lavery, MIT License, are installed by Set up from their own repos; no code from them ships here.

Also installed by Set up from their own repos, not bundled: superpowers (https://github.com/obra/superpowers) by Jesse Vincent, ponytail (https://github.com/DietrichGebert/ponytail) by Dietrich Gebert, impeccable (https://github.com/pbakaus/impeccable) by Paul Bakaus, and grill-me by Matt Pocock (https://github.com/mattpocock/skills).

