kit/design-md/INDEX.md and the starnet-station, colony-sim-rooms, tactics-hud and palace-vermilion entries are original to Switchboard: written descriptions with source links, no copied images.

The Desk layout embeds Hanken Grotesk (web/app/fonts/hanken.css), Copyright 2020 The Hanken Grotesk Project Authors (https://github.com/marcologous/hanken-grotesk), used under the SIL Open Font License 1.1 (https://openfontlicense.org).

